# Converted from the old Grade 2 Survex data (Grade2/Grade2/CrystalMaze.svx).

# > Ogof Draenen: Crystal Maze
# 
# This data represents a fairly rough compass & tape survey with
# occasional estimated clino readings.
# 
# Survey conducted on Sunday 4th December by Morgannwg Caving Club.
# Surveyed by: Ali Garman & Will Knight
# Data entry: Ali Garman & Tim Long (data supplied on disk by Ali)
# Survey continued by Ali & Will on 11/12/94

survey crystalmaze

# Station Equivalences

# Crystal Maze station 25 = Chocolate Blorenge station A

# (25 is the start of the Crystal Maze, near the water fall
# which hasn't been surveyed yet either, not far from where
# you popped through and met us when you were with Ben Thorpe)

# Specify units of measurement

# Magnetic North to Grid North correction
# Mag deviation at the time of the readings (9-Oct-94) was
# 4.2 degrees (data from OS sheet 161, 1991).

# Data ordering

centreline
  # BCRA2
  sd length 0.5 metres
  sd compass clino 2.5 degrees
  calibrate compass 4.2
  data normal from to length compass clino
  1	2	7.7	294	0	# 1 = The Swim station 12
  2	3	17.8	313	0	# junction which follows 300m loop
  # round to station 7 (as yet
  # unsurveyed but takes a good
  # draft in the opposite direction,
  # therefore return expected!!)
  3	4	13.3	24	0
  4	4a	4	78	0	# junction - dig probably connects
  # through to The Swim around
  # station 14
  4	5	3.4	268	0
  5	6	5.2	335	0
  6	7	2.9	265	0	# junction which follows loop
  # around to station 3
  7	7a	4.0	262	0
  7	8	1.0	344	0
  8	9	4.2	44	0
  9	10	1.2	314	0
  10	11	2.0	62	0
  11	12	12.2	325	0
  12	13	4.2	7	0
  13	14	2.9	76	0
  14	15	10.8	322	0
  15	16	10.9	330	0
  16	17	13.0	344	0
  17	18	0.9	280	0	# I had to get one under a metre!
  18	19	7.5	331	0
  19	20	4.4	352	0
  20	21	4.7	318	0
  21	22	5.4	1	0
  22	23	2.1	72	0
  23	24	3.7	348	0
  24	25	6.3	0	0

endcentreline
endsurvey
